{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"h":0.019229029341124471,"t":"Reading","y":0.051166184136207549,"w":0.070956471761067674,"x":0.84181230095867177,"c":1},{"y":0.10036924596390073,"t":"'The new buses are much, much better,' says Paulas George, a young IT worker.","x":0.19198133115361032,"w":0.65583536783854157,"h":0.021153585488684512,"c":1},{"w":0.66089965820312491,"h":0.01756900269472994,"t":"He takes the bus every day and it has cut his journey time by two-thirds. He says","x":0.19204152032317809,"y":0.1206395346007223,"c":1},{"t":"it is not perfect, though, complaining that drivers often refuse to turn on the air","w":0.65583435058593753,"h":0.0204306749967198,"c":1,"y":0.13751316299399918,"x":0.19025304102112386},{"t":"conditioning to save fuel.","x":0.19014730234949137,"y":0.1565168145551098,"h":0.020417785377582542,"c":1,"w":0.22006017049153645},{"t":"That is not the only problem. A shortage of buses after a serious flood at the","x":0.19024256105056045,"w":0.63336532592773431,"y":0.1921353908715091,"c":1,"h":0.021425985305604578},{"w":0.66795908610026045,"h":0.021432832540374536,"y":0.21019594551218568,"x":0.19197192502471372,"t":"main depot during the rainy season means the system is carrying 200,000 people","c":1},{"w":0.65244440714518226,"h":0.021188993567432757,"c":1,"t":"a day - half the expected capacity. Smartcards can't be used as the mechanical","x":0.19195352415210135,"y":0.22860649645605258},{"w":0.68685119628906244,"h":0.019016387998181949,"c":1,"t":"readers aren't working either, forcing passengers to buy individual paper tickets for","x":0.19031142602444656,"y":0.24842547243242041},{"t":"every journey. Each is printed with a scannable QR code, but there are no scanners.","w":0.69031143188476551,"y":0.26731980388425103,"c":1,"h":0.01756391732153828,"x":0.19204151579520054},{"t":"Staff stand by the gates and tear tickets as people enter. As a result, queues are","y":0.28481455569268088,"w":0.65743942260742194,"h":0.01896451385476694,"c":1,"x":0.19204153862708484},{"x":0.1920415202049035,"y":0.30510846776053602,"w":0.23010381062825519,"h":0.01611246238478925,"t":"considerable at peak times.","c":1},{"t":"Morogoro Road to the north-west of the city was phase I of the BRT project. Phases II","w":0.70773117065429691,"y":0.33846916079405676,"x":0.19198224914988504,"h":0.020763780955587507,"c":1},{"w":0.69214009602864568,"h":0.019714749218117888,"t":"and III will install bus lanes along Nyerere Road to the south-west and Kilwa Road to","y":0.3574762318586,"c":1,"x":0.19199081235662269},{"x":0.19198175401487039,"w":0.69042902628580716,"y":0.37576329623251437,"h":0.01986045583801066,"c":1,"t":"the south. Construction on both routes is due to start imminently. Phase IV, towards"},{"h":0.023539388988967458,"c":1,"y":0.39243369911095094,"t":"Bagamoyo in the north, is in the preliminary design stage. 'Much of the city will have","x":0.19195491810509849,"w":0.695686747233073},{"h":0.019033679601777487,"c":1,"t":"access to a world-class transport system within the space of a few years,' says Chris","y":0.41133720931447082,"w":0.68512110392252601,"x":0.19204152465811414},{"t":"Kost, the Africa director of ITDP (the Institute for Transportation and Development","x":0.19197744854746956,"w":0.68179148356119801,"h":0.020254382059405662,"c":1,"y":0.43050184126903868},{"c":1,"w":0.68526448567708331,"h":0.021147764004386449,"x":0.19197954678189394,"t":"Policy). All phases are being planned to high standards and, once complete, a third","y":0.44915942070777226},{"y":0.46947674390365346,"t":"of city residents will be within a short walk of the BRT network.","c":1,"w":0.51730102539062495,"h":0.01757713995920851,"x":0.19204152874157482},{"c":1,"t":"The ITDP regrets Africa's obsession with metros. 'With a metro, an international","h":0.020472026688807321,"y":0.5043347854983814,"x":0.19198839611502155,"w":0.65584035237630212},{"h":0.023884841993691008,"y":0.52060624273168665,"c":1,"x":0.19192896672209561,"w":0.67670547485351562,"t":"firm will often just parachute in its own system,' says Kost. 'Bus rapid transit allows"},{"c":1,"w":0.69232777913411447,"t":"existing stakeholders to get involved. That's what we did in Dar es Salaam and what","x":0.19190593003179762,"y":0.53898335239475315,"h":0.023696987507141443},{"y":0.55811575139071423,"x":0.19194758742617068,"h":0.022810827192516148,"c":1,"t":"we're planning in Nairobi, where the bus bodies will be built in the city and local","w":0.66284281412760415},{"h":0.019007233659064871,"y":0.57837648723639279,"c":1,"t":"operators will look after tickets, fare collection and IT ...Bus rapid transit has been","w":0.67474049886067711,"x":0.19204151522357232},{"x":0.19204151660482902,"y":0.59587123891591576,"w":0.70588236490885414,"t":"transformational for Dar es Salaam. For millions of people in African cities, this is their","h":0.018954342441011574,"c":1},{"h":0.020478141149329998,"t":"best hope of ever being connected.'","y":0.61474772162391611,"c":1,"x":0.19191033518810929,"w":0.30482215881347657},{"t":"65","w":0.02422145207722981,"x":0.88927335704096988,"y":0.95058139526655483,"h":0.015988371937820434,"c":1}]}